kedu.guide.main.title=Universal Camo
kedu.guide.main.header=Addon manual
kedu.guide.main.body=Camo Blocks adds camouflage shapes, building tools and special blocks for decorating, measuring, rotating and building with more control.\n\nChoose a category below. Pages are separated for quick reading on PC and mobile.
