kedu.guide.compat.title=Guidebook - Compatibility
kedu.guide.compat.header=Compatible blocks
kedu.guide.compat.before_count=The catalog contains
kedu.guide.compat.after_count=compatible Vanilla block IDs.
kedu.guide.compat.body=The generated list below is the exact compatibility catalog for this version. Glass uses blend and is the only material with culling between Camo blocks. Leaves and vines use alpha_test. Every other material uses opaque. The grass and Netherrack families include grass, grass_block, grass_path, dirt_path, mycelium, podzol, netherrack, crimson_nylium, warped_nylium, nether_wart_block and warped_wart_block. Luminous blocks such as minecraft:sea_lantern, minecraft:glowstone and minecraft:shroomlight remain compatible. Saplings, flowers, crops, pots, buttons, pressure plates and other tiny decorations are intentionally omitted.\n\nNot compatible: non-block items and blocks from other addons that are not present in this generated catalog.
